# Parameters\n\n- `customer_id: string`\n\n- `dashboard: 'invoices' | 'usage' | 'credits' | 'commits_and_credits'`\n  The type of dashboard to retrieve.\n\n- `bm_group_key_overrides?: { group_key_name: string; display_name?: string; value_display_names?: object; }[]`\n  Optional list of billable metric group key overrides\n\n- `color_overrides?: { name?: string; value?: string; }[]`\n  Optional list of colors to override\n\n- `dashboard_options?: { key: string; value: string; }[]`\n  Optional dashboard specific options\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ data: { url?: string; }; }`\n\n  - `data: { url?: string; }`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Metronome from '@metronome/sdk';\n\nconst client = new Metronome();\n\nconst response = await client.v1.dashboards.getEmbeddableURL({ customer_id: '4db51251-61de-4bfe-b9ce-495e244f3491', dashboard: 'invoices' });\n\nconsole.log(response);\n```",
